# 89-router-shell-tour-single-toolbar.patch
#
# feat/fue-app-shell-onboarding adds tour refs/vars + an inline toolbar that
# rerere drops (take HEAD's single <SessionList headerActions> toolbar). Without
# this heal the tour refs are defined-but-unused (typecheck fail) and the tour
# is dead. Upstream also wrapped browse in `{canBrowse && (...)}` and moved
# refresh into SessionList (onRefresh) — so this heal targets that shape.
#
# Folds into headerActions: tour refs/FueDot on browse/settings/new, Overseer
# nav button (-> /overseer) between browse and settings (from #103 admin-console
# — previously heal 93, merged here after canBrowse context drift made the
# split 89+93 3-way-conflict), and FueCallout after SessionList.
# Net: ONE toolbar, tour intact, Overseer console reachable from the shell.
#
# If remat still leaves the OUTER chrome action cluster (count-row buttons)
# stacked above headerActions, heal 97-router-strip-outer-duplicate-toolbar
# deletes that outer cluster. Apply order: 89 then 97.
